<p dir="auto" data-start="41" data-end="114">For Task 3, I'd say you're around <strong data-start="75" data-end="90">70–75% done</strong> with the Power BI part.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1wqsd71" dir="auto" data-start="116" data-end="132">What is left</h3>
<div dir="auto" class="group TyagGW_tableContainer TyagGW_tableContainerWithTableOfContents"><div tabindex="-1" class="TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="134" data-end="709" dir="auto" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="134" data-end="156"><tr data-start="134" data-end="156"><th data-start="134" data-end="141" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10">Step</th><th data-start="141" data-end="148" data-col-size="md" class="last:pe-10">Work</th><th data-start="148" data-end="156" data-col-size="sm" class="last:pe-10" style="text-align: right;">Time</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="172" data-end="709"><tr data-start="172" data-end="205"><td data-start="172" data-end="178" data-col-size="sm">✅ 1</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="178" data-end="197">Download dataset</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="197" data-end="205" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="206" data-end="237"><td data-start="206" data-end="212" data-col-size="sm">✅ 2</td><td data-start="212" data-end="229" data-col-size="md">Import dataset</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="229" data-end="237" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="238" data-end="265"><td data-start="238" data-end="244" data-col-size="sm">✅ 3</td><td data-start="244" data-end="257" data-col-size="md">Clean data</td><td data-start="257" data-end="265" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="266" data-end="302"><td data-start="266" data-end="272" data-col-size="sm">✅ 4</td><td data-start="272" data-end="294" data-col-size="md">Create DAX measures</td><td data-start="294" data-end="302" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="303" data-end="329"><td data-start="303" data-end="309" data-col-size="sm">✅ 5</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="309" data-end="321">KPI cards</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="321" data-end="329" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="330" data-end="360"><td data-start="330" data-end="336" data-col-size="sm">✅ 6</td><td data-start="336" data-end="352" data-col-size="md">Create charts</td><td data-start="352" data-end="360" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="361" data-end="389"><td data-start="361" data-end="367" data-col-size="sm">✅ 7</td><td data-start="367" data-end="381" data-col-size="md">Add slicers</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="381" data-end="389" style="text-align: right;">Done</td></tr><tr data-start="390" data-end="441"><td data-start="390" data-end="397" data-col-size="sm">🔜 8</td><td data-start="397" data-end="430" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="399" data-end="429">Arrange &amp; format dashboard</strong></td><td data-start="430" data-end="441" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">~15 min</td></tr><tr data-start="442" data-end="497"><td data-start="442" data-end="449" data-col-size="sm">🔜 9</td><td data-start="449" data-end="486" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="451" data-end="485">Add dashboard title / insights</strong></td><td data-start="486" data-end="497" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">~10 min</td></tr><tr data-start="498" data-end="565"><td data-start="498" data-end="506" data-col-size="sm">🔜 10</td><td data-start="506" data-end="554" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="508" data-end="553">Write business insights &amp; recommendations</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="554" data-end="565" style="text-align: right;">~10 min</td></tr><tr data-start="566" data-end="616"><td data-start="566" data-end="574" data-col-size="sm">🔜 11</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="574" data-end="606"><strong data-start="576" data-end="605">Take dashboard screenshot</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="606" data-end="616" style="text-align: right;">~2 min</td></tr><tr data-start="617" data-end="659"><td data-start="617" data-end="625" data-col-size="sm">🔜 12</td><td data-start="625" data-end="648" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="627" data-end="647">Create README.md</strong></td><td data-start="648" data-end="659" data-col-size="sm" style="text-align: right;">~10 min</td></tr><tr data-start="660" data-end="709"><td data-start="660" data-end="668" data-col-size="sm">🔜 13</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="668" data-end="698"><strong data-start="670" data-end="697">Upload Task 3 to GitHub</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="698" data-end="709" style="text-align: right;">~10 min</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="relative h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 33.2188px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary relative z-10 my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<h3 data-section-id="2n8ff8" dir="auto" data-start="711" data-end="749"><span role="text">So roughly <strong data-start="726" data-end="748">45–60 minutes left</strong>.</span></h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="751" data-end="875">And we <strong data-start="758" data-end="800">don't need to make it more complicated</strong>. Your dashboard already has enough visuals and interactivity for the task.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1iq5i17" dir="auto" data-start="877" data-end="911">Your final Task 3 will contain</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="913" data-end="1113"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Task-3-Customer-Churn-Dashboard
