601 2.23613 16.9199 2.27621 16.753H2.27425L3.1639 12.8956C3.38813 11.8986 3.89924 11.028 4.6014 10.3272L11.6258 3.30375ZM5.54183 11.2686C5.00143 11.8078 4.62462 12.4592 4.46078 13.1905L4.4598 13.1944L3.7557 16.2461L6.81722 15.543C7.52306 15.3789 8.20539 15.0001 8.73617 14.4405L14.3944 8.78129L11.2118 5.5977L5.54183 11.2686ZM15.742 4.23637C14.9045 3.37296 13.4757 3.3368 12.5653 4.24516L12.1522 4.65727L15.3348 7.84086L15.7489 7.42778C16.6655 6.51112 16.6228 5.08792 15.7577 4.252L15.742 4.23637Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:6097eac3-47b1-4f33-824d-cd1eb5b6292b-12" data-is-intersecting="true"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="request-WEB:6097eac3-47b1-4f33-824d-cd1eb5b6292b-12" data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:6097eac3-47b1-4f33-824d-cd1eb5b6292b-12" data-testid="conversation-turn-26" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b89e67d9-4524-4ab8-a642-69c7495fd1c3" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-turn-start-message="true" tabindex="0"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="43">Let's finish the Power BI dashboard now. 👍</p>
<h1 data-section-id="1cri1zt" dir="auto" data-start="45" data-end="77">Step 16 — Format the Dashboard</h1>
<p dir="auto" data-start="79" data-end="128">First, make sure your page contains all of these:</p>
<ul data-start="130" data-end="199">
<li data-section-id="cijgr2" data-start="130" data-end="154">
<p dir="auto" data-start="132" data-end="154">4 KPI cards at the top</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gtuerx" data-start="155" data-end="177">
<p dir="auto" data-start="157" data-end="177">3 slicers below them</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="kv02m4" data-start="178" data-end="199">
<p dir="auto" data-start="180" data-end="199">5 charts underneath</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id="63zm2u" dir="auto" data-start="201" data-end="230">1. Add the dashboard title</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="232" data-end="238">Go to:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="240" data-end="261"><strong data-start="240" data-end="261">Insert → Text box</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="263" data-end="268">Type:</p>
<blockquote data-start="270" data-end="312">
<p dir="auto" data-start="272" data-end="312"><strong data-start="272" data-end="312">CUSTOMER CHURN &amp; RETENTION DASHBOARD</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto" data-start="314" data-end="339">Place it at the very top.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="341" data-end="374">Under it, add a smaller subtitle:</p>
<blockquote data-start="376" data-end="450">
<p dir="auto" data-start="378" data-end="450"><em data-start="378" data-end="450">Executive overview of customer churn patterns and retention indicators</em></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="452" data-end="455">
<h2 data-section-id="6irvqs" dir="auto" data-start="457" data-end="481">2. Arrange everything</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="483" data-end="499">Use this layout:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="501" data-end="1296"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│       CUSTOMER CHURN &amp; RETENTION DASHBOARD          │
│      Executive overview of customer churn           │
├──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬────────────────────┤
│ Customers│ Churned  │ Churn %  │ Avg Monthly Charge │
├──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴────────────────────┤
│ Contract ▼ │ Gender ▼ │ Internet Service ▼          │
├─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┤
│ Churn by Contract       │ Churn by Internet Service │
├─────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤
│ Churn by Tenure         │ Churn by Payment Method   │
├─────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┤
│ Average Monthly Charges by Churn                    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1298" data-end="1359">Don't worry if your exact chart sizes are slightly different.</p>
<hr data-start="1361" data-end="1364">
<h2 data-section-id="1cafg94" dir="auto" data-start="1366" data-end="1397">3. Make the background clean</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1399" data-end="1433">Click an empty area of the report.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1435" data-end="1441">Go to:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1443" data-end="1484"><strong data-start="1443" data-end="1484">Format → Canvas settings → Background</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1486" data-end="1535">Choose a <strong data-start="1495" data-end="1523">very light gray or white</strong> background.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1537" data-end="1552">Keep it simple.</p>
<hr data-start="1554" data-end="1557">
<h2 data-section-id="1ipkzn4" dir="auto" data-start="1559" data-end="1585">4. Format the KPI cards</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1587" data-end="1601">For each card:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1603" data-end="1636"><strong data-start="1603" data-end="1636">Format visual → Callout value</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1638" data-end="1675">Set the number size around <strong data-start="1665" data-end="1674">24–30</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1677" data-end="1719">For the card titles, use around <strong data-start="1709" data-end="1718">12–14</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1721" data-end="1808">Don't use too many colors. A clean business dashboard looks better than a colorful one.</p>
<hr data-start="1810" data-end="1813">
<h2 data-section-id="1qaynr1" dir="auto" data-start="1815" data-end="1841">5. Turn on chart titles</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1843" data-end="1858">For each chart:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1860" data-end="1900"><strong data-start="1860" data-end="1900">Format visual → General → Title → On</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1902" data-end="1925">Use these exact titles:</p>
<ol data-start="1927" data-end="2117">
<li data-section-id="jfwrdh" data-start="1927" data-end="1960">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1930" data-end="1960"><strong data-start="1930" data-end="1960">Customer Churn by Contract</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gq9dnm" data-start="1961" data-end="2002">
<p dir="auto" data-start="1964" data-end="2002"><strong data-start="1964" data-end="2002">Customer Churn by Internet Service</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1s96e0" data-start="2003" data-end="2034">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2006" data-end="2034"><strong data-start="2006" data-end="2034">Customer Churn by Tenure</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19olh1x" data-start="2035" data-end="2077">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2038" data-end="2077"><strong data-start="2038" data-end="2077">Churned Customers by Payment Method</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fc8xmw" data-start="2078" data-end="2117">
<p dir="auto" data-start="2081" data-end="2117"><strong data-start="2081" data-end="2117">Average Monthly Charges by Churn</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="2119" data-end="2122">
<h1 data-section-id="cm2mq4" dir="auto" data-start="2124" data-end="2163">Step 17 — Add a Key Insights Text Box</h1>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2165" data-end="2296">This is important because the ShadowFox task specifically asks for <strong data-start="2232" data-end="2295">business storytelling and decision-oriented recommendations</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2298" data-end="2304">Go to:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2306" data-end="2327"><strong data-start="2306" data-end="2327">Insert → Text box</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2329" data-end="2333">Add:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="cg7qo2" dir="auto" data-start="2335" data-end="2360" class="" style="">Key Business Insights</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2362" data-end="2810"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>• Month-to-month customers show higher churn compared with longer-term contracts.

• Customers using different internet services show noticeable differences in churn.

• Customer churn is more concentrated among newer customers with shorter tenure.

• Payment method patterns indicate differences in churn behavior across customer groups.

• Customers who churn show different average monthly charges compared with customers who remain.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="2812" data-end="2821">Then add:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1k84mey" dir="auto" data-start="2823" data-end="2851" class="" style="">Business Recommendations</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2853" data-end="3272"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>• Encourage customers to move from month-to-month contracts to longer-term plans.

• Focus retention efforts on customers during their first year.

• Investigate service-related factors among high-churn customer segments.

• Review payment-method patterns and identify opportunities to improve customer convenience.

• Use the dashboard regularly to identify customer segments requiring retention attention.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="3274" data-end="3277">
<h2 data-section-id="edto80" dir="auto" data-start="3279" data-end="3303">Step 18 — Final Check</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="3305" data-end="3350">Before saving, check that your dashboard has:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="3352" data-end="3490">✅ 4 KPIs<br data-start="3360" data-end="3363">
✅ 5 charts<br data-start="3373" data-end="3376">
✅ 3 slicers<br data-start="3387" data-end="3390">
✅ Dashboard title<br data-start="3407" data-end="3410">
✅ Key Insights<br data-start="3424" data-end="3427">
✅ Recommendations<br data-start="3444" data-end="3447">
✅ Clean layout<br data-start="3461" data-end="3464">
✅ No unnecessary visuals</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="3492" data-end="3523">Then save the Power BI file as:</p>
