<h3 data-section-id="11y5iuc" dir="auto" data-start="3674" data-end="3688">After this</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="3690" data-end="3727">The <strong data-start="3694" data-end="3723">Power BI work is finished</strong>. 🎉</p>
